category: Libs
requires: libadios2-devel libfides1 libviskores-devel pkg-config libadios2-devel rapidjson-devel
sdesc: "Library for reading ADIOS2 data into Viskores datasets (development)"
ldesc: "Fides is a library that provides a schema for reading and writing
data stored in ADIOS2 using a JSON-based data model, and for turning it into
Viskores datasets for visualization."
external-source: fides

